{"path":"services.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fcfbf9;--accent:#6a8f6e;--muted:#6b6b6b;--card:#fff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#10221f;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f4f8f6) fixed;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 28px;background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);position:sticky;top:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(16,34,31,0.06)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#8db597);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:24px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:22px;align-items:start}
    .hero .panel{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,23,20,0.06)}
    .lead{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#0f332d}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:#4e6b61}
    .inventory{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .areas{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
    label.option{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(16,34,31,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #fbfffb)}
    input[type=checkbox]{width:18px;height:18px}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    button{border:0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#0f332d;color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:#e9f0ea;color:#0f332d;border:1px solid rgba(15,51,45,0.06)}
    .result{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fff8,#ffffff);border:1px dashed rgba(106,143,110,0.12)}
    .agenda{margin:10px 0;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 8px;background:#eef7ef;border-radius:6px;margin-right:8px;font-size:13px}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    /* modal */
    .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,15,13,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
    .modal.open{display:flex}
    .modal-card{width:680px;max-width:100%;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(4,10,8,0.3)}
    .modal-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .exercise-area{margin-top:12px}
    .breath-circle{width:180px;height:180px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #dff3e6, #fff);margin:16px auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#0f332d}
    .timer{font-size:28px}
    .journal-input, .intent-input{width:100%;min-height:120px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6ece5}
    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .pattern{position:fixed;right:0;top:120px;width:180px;height:240px;opacity:0.08;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:cover}
    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}} 
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="panel">
        <h1 style="margin-top:0">Personalized care tracks for complex lives</h1>
        <p class="lead">We frame care around what you already manage — habits, demands, symptoms, and goals. Choose a service and then build the first agenda together.</p>
        <p class="sub">Educational assessments and practical plans. No promises of cures — just steady, evidence-aware supports you can try between visits.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:18px">Service pathways (examples)</h3>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:8px">
          <div class="agenda">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Home Rhythm Tune-up</div>
            <div class="meta">Short cycle: 4 weekly touchpoints. Focus: sleep, stress momentum, and routine.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="agenda">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Foundations Series</div>
            <div class="meta">8-week guided track. Focus: movement, nourishment, and chronic symptom mapping.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="agenda">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Supportive Consult</div>
            <div class="meta">Single-session consult to orient priorities and produce a modular plan.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:10px">
          <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button class="secondary" id="open-exercise">Try a guided practice</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Whole‑person inventory</h3>
        <p class="small">Tick areas you want us to prioritise. We’ll translate your choices into a clear first-session agenda and a sensible follow-up cadence.</p>
        <form id="inventoryForm" class="inventory" onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="areas">
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Sleep"> Sleep & recovery</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Energy"> Energy & stamina</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Movement"> Movement & flexibility</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Nutrition"> Nutrition patterns</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Stress"> Stress & worry</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Mood"> Mood & motivation</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Relations"> Social & relationships</label>
            <label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="areas" value="Symptoms"> Symptom tracking</label>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
            <div class="controls">
              <button type="button" id="generate">Generate agenda</button>
              <button type="button" id="clear" class="secondary">Clear</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="result" class="result" aria-live="polite" hidden>
            <div style="font-weight:800">Draft consultation agenda</div>
            <div id="agendaOut"></div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px" class="meta">Suggested follow-up cadence</div>
            <div id="cadenceOut"></div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">If you prefer, book a short orientation and we’ll bring the inventory to your first consult for a live walk-through.</div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 280px;gap:20px">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">How our planning works</h3>
        <p class="small">We treat your time as the scarce resource. After the inventory, we allocate attention in the first session and design micro steps you can try between visits. The plan we recommend adapts: a short check-in if you have immediate needs, a paced series if you need skill-building.</p>

        <h4 style="margin-top:14px">What we’ll deliver</h4>
        <ul style="margin:6px 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)">
          <li>A focused agenda for the initial session</li>
          <li>Three prioritized goals with clear micro-habits</li>
          <li>A follow-up cadence (2-week, 6-week, 12-week suggestions)</li>
          <li>Simple measures to track progress between visits</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
      <aside class="panel">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0">Quick micro-practices</h4>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
          <div><span class="pill">2 min</span> A paced breathing set before bed</div>
          <div><span class="pill">5 min</span> A morning intention & quick journaling</div>
          <div><span class="pill">10 min</span> Gentle mobility sequence</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div id="exerciseModal" class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <div>
          <strong id="exTitle">Guided practice</strong>
          <div class="meta">Choose a short exercise. No tracking, only presence.</div>
        </div>
        <button id="closeExercise" aria-label="close">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
        <select id="exerciseType" style="padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6ece5">
          <option value="breath">Breathing – 3-minute cycle</option>
          <option value="journal">Micro journaling – prompts</option>
          <option value="intent">Intention setting – short</option>
        </select>
        <button class="secondary" id="startExercise">Begin</button>
      </div>

      <div class="exercise-area" id="exerciseArea">
        <!-- dynamic content -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px">
      <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">Comfort-forward, evidence-aware care</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Inventory logic: map selections to agenda and cadence
    const generateBtn = document.getElementById('generate');
    const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear');
    const result = document.getElementById('result');
    const agendaOut = document.getElementById('agendaOut');
    const cadenceOut = document.getElementById('cadenceOut');

    const areaToFocus = {
      'Sleep': {time:15, notes:'Review sleep habits, timing, and simple bedtime routines.'},
      'Energy': {time:10, notes:'Assess daily energy blocks and nutrient timing.'},
      'Movement': {time:12, notes:'Screen mobility and propose a 10-minute plan.'},
      'Nutrition': {time:12, notes:'Brief diet recall and one practical change.'},
      'Stress': {time:14, notes:'Explore triggers and introduce a paced breathing tool.'},
      'Mood': {time:12, notes:'Mood mapping and behavior activation ideas.'},
      'Relations': {time:8, notes:'Identify social supports and boundaries.'},
      'Symptoms': {time:16, notes:'Symptom timeline, red flags, and tracking plan.'}
    };

    function buildAgenda(selected){
      if(selected.length===0) return {agenda:[{title:'Orientation',time:10,notes:'Understand your goals and current concerns.'}], cadence:['Check-in: 2 weeks','Review: 6 weeks']};
      let agenda = [];
      let total = 0;
      selected.forEach(s=>{
        if(areaToFocus[s]){
          agenda.push({title:s, time: areaToFocus[s].time, notes: areaToFocus[s].notes});
          total += areaToFocus[s].time;
        }
      });
      // keep first session ~45min; prioritize top items by time
      agenda.sort((a,b)=>b.time-a.time);
      let trimmed = [];
      let acc=0;
      for(const item of agenda){
        if(acc + item.time <= 42 || trimmed.length<3){ trimmed.push(item); acc += item.time }
      }
      let cadence = [];
      // cadence rules: if many symptom items -> tighter cadence
      const hasSymptoms = selected.includes('Symptoms') || selected.includes('Mood');
      cadence.push('Short check-in: 2 weeks');
      cadence.push(hasSymptoms? 'Active follow-up: 4 weeks' : 'Practice review: 6 weeks');
      cadence.push('Long-term review: 12 weeks');
      return {agenda:trimmed, cadence};
    }

    generateBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const chosen = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('input[name="areas"]:checked')).map(i=>i.value);
      const out = buildAgenda(chosen);
      agendaOut.innerHTML = '';
      out.agenda.forEach(a=>{
        const el = document.createElement('div'); el.className='agenda'; el.innerHTML = '<div style="font-weight:800">'+a.title+' <span style="font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">('+a.time+' min)</span></div><div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">'+a.notes+'</div>';
        agendaOut.appendChild(el);
      });
      cadenceOut.innerHTML = out.cadence.map(c=>'<div class="pill">'+c+'</div>').join('');
      result.hidden = false;
      result.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
    });

    clearBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.querySelectorAll('input[name="areas"]:checked').forEach(c=>c.checked=false);
      result.hidden = true;
    });

    // Guided exercise modal logic (simple, self-contained)
    const modal = document.getElementById('exerciseModal');
    const openExercise = document.getElementById('open-exercise');
    const closeExercise = document.getElementById('closeExercise');
    const startExercise = document.getElementById('startExercise');
    const exerciseArea = document.getElementById('exerciseArea');
    const exerciseType = document.getElementById('exerciseType');
    const exTitle = document.getElementById('exTitle');

    function showModal(){ modal.classList.add('open'); }
    function hideModal(){ modal.classList.remove('open'); clearInterval(window.__breathInterval); }

    openExercise.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ showModal(); });
    closeExercise.addEventListener('click', hideModal);
    modal.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) hideModal(); });

    startExercise.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const kind = exerciseType.value; exTitle.textContent = {breath:'Breathing practice',journal:'Micro journaling',intent:'Intention setting'}[kind];
      exerciseArea.innerHTML = '';
      if(kind==='breath') renderBreath();
      if(kind==='journal') renderJournal();
      if(kind==='intent') renderIntent();
    });

    function renderBreath(){
      exerciseArea.innerHTML = '<div class="meta">Find a comfortable seat. Follow the visual breathing for 3 minutes.</div><div class="breath-circle" id="breathCircle"><div class="timer" id="breathLabel">Ready</div></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:6px"><button id="beginBreath">Start 3-min</button></div>';
      document.getElementById('beginBreath').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const label = document.getElementById('breathLabel');
        const circle = document.getElementById('breathCircle');
        let total = 180; // seconds
        let phase = 0; // 0 inhale,1 hold,2 exhale,3 hold
        const pattern = [4,1,6,1]; // seconds
        let phaseRemain = pattern[phase];
        label.textContent = formatTime(total);
        // animate simple scale with breath cycle
        window.__breathInterval = setInterval(()=>{
          total--; phaseRemain--;
          if(phaseRemain<=0){ phase=(phase+1)%4; phaseRemain=pattern[phase]; }
          // visual scale by phase (inhale expand)
          const scale = 1 + ((phase===0)?0.25*(1 - phaseRemain/pattern[0]) : (phase===2)?0.25*(phaseRemain/pattern[2]) : 0);
          circle.style.transform = 'scale('+scale+')';
          label.textContent = Math.max(0,total)+'s ('+['inhale','hold','exhale','hold'][phase]+')';
          if(total<=0){ clearInterval(window.__breathInterval); label.textContent='Complete'; }
        },1000);
      });
    }
    function formatTime(s){return Math.floor(s/60)+':'+String(s%60).padStart(2,'0');}

    function renderJournal(){
      exerciseArea.innerHTML = '<div class="meta">A short prompt to anchor reflection. Write for 5 minutes then review.</div><textarea class="journal-input" id="journalText" placeholder="What felt important this week? What do I want more of?"></textarea><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button id="startJournal">Start 5-min timer</button><button id="saveJournal" class="secondary">Save locally</button></div><div id="journalState" class="meta" style="margin-top:8px"></div>';
      const start = document.getElementById('startJournal');
      const save = document.getElementById('saveJournal');
      const tstate = document.getElementById('journalState');
      let timer;
      start.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        let remain = 300; tstate.textContent = '5:00';
        clearInterval(timer);
        timer = setInterval(()=>{ remain--; tstate.textContent = formatTime(remain); if(remain<=0){ clearInterval(timer); tstate.textContent='Time complete'; } },1000);
      });
      save.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const val = document.getElementById('journalText').value.trim();
        if(!val){ tstate.textContent = 'Write something to save.'; return; }
        const key = 'hm_journal_'+new Date().toISOString();
        try{ localStorage.setItem(key,val); tstate.textContent='Saved locally.'; }catch(e){ tstate.textContent='Save failed.'; }
      });
    }

    function renderIntent(){
      exerciseArea.innerHTML = '<div class="meta">Set one concise intention you can practice today.</div><input class="intent-input" id="intentText" placeholder="Today I will... (keep it small)"/><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button id="saveIntent">Set intention</button><button id="clearIntent" class="secondary">Clear</button></div><div id="intentState" class="meta" style="margin-top:8px"></div>';
      document.getElementById('saveIntent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const v = document.getElementById('intentText').value.trim();
        if(!v){ document.getElementById('intentState').textContent='Write a small, specific intention.'; return; }
        localStorage.setItem('hm_intent', v);
        document.getElementById('intentState').textContent='Intent set: '+v;
      });
      document.getElementById('clearIntent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ document.getElementById('intentText').value=''; document.getElementById('intentState').textContent='Cleared.'; localStorage.removeItem('hm_intent'); });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"conditions.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Conditions — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffefb;--accent:#7a6a9f;--muted:#58615f}
    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f7faf9);color:#12221f}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 22px;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,22,20,0.04)}
    .logo{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8a6fb0,#bfa7e0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:900px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}
    .hero{padding:18px;background:white;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(14,18,16,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .lead{color:var(--muted)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 260px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{padding:14px;background:white;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,15,12,0.04)}
    .condition{margin-bottom:10px}
    .disclaimer{background:#fff4f0;border-left:4px solid #f2c6b2;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;color:#6b3a2b}
    .support{background:#f5fffc;border-left:4px solid #bfeeda;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;color:#11523a}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    footer{max-width:900px;margin:22px auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}} 
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Conditions we commonly support</h1>
      <p class="lead">We provide education, symptom management strategies, and practical support for daily functioning. Our intent is to help you try things that can improve quality of life — not to promise cures. If you have urgent or life-threatening symptoms, contact emergency services or your primary care clinician.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Examples of areas we often work with</h3>
          <div class="condition"><strong>Mental health patterns</strong> — low mood, anxiety, burnout: we offer behavioral activation, pacing, and strategies that fit your schedule.</div>
          <div class="condition"><strong>Sleep challenges</strong> — difficulty falling or staying asleep: practical sleep-support routines and troubleshooting that are realistic for your life.</div>
          <div class="condition"><strong>Chronic pain & fatigue</strong> — symptom mapping, activity pacing, and gentle movement plans to reduce flare cycles.</div>
          <div class="condition"><strong>Digestive discomfort</strong> — pattern tracking and small dietary steps; we collaborate with digestive specialists when needed.</div>
          <div class="condition"><strong>Hormonal transitions</strong> — cycle or menopause-related changes: symptom-focused strategies and timing adjustments.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">What to expect if you bring a condition to us</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)">
            <li>A careful history and timeline of symptoms</li>
            <li>Simple measurements and tracking tools you can use between visits</li>
            <li>Stepwise, low-friction changes to test</li>
            <li>Clear referral if medical evaluation is warranted</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Important disclaimer</h4>
          <p class="disclaimer">This site provides educational content and care planning. Nothing here replaces urgent care, emergency services, or specialist medical advice. If you have severe pain, shortness of breath, suicidal thoughts, or other urgent concerns, call emergency services or your primary clinician immediately.</p>

          <h4 style="margin-top:12px">Supportive approach</h4>
          <p class="support">We work collaboratively and respectfully. Our recommendations are framed as options to try. You remain in control of choices; we offer tools to help you test what may fit your life.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a class="btn" href="book.html">Reserve an orientation</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">When we refer</h4>
          <p class="muted">We will recommend referral when there are signs that specialized medical assessment, urgent evaluation, or coordinated care is needed. Referrals are part of good integrative care.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Practical steps you can take now</h3>
      <ol style="color:var(--muted)">
        <li>Note the pattern: keep a simple symptom and context log for 7–14 days.</li>
        <li>Pick one small experiment (one change for 7 days) rather than many.</li>
        <li>Share the log with your clinician or bring it to your first consult.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="muted">If you’d like a template log or a quick 20-minute orientation to set up your tracking, see our booking page.</p>
    </section>

